## Outcome
The train ships:
- all field issues #28–#56 fixed at the bug-class level;
- a deliberate external-client live test for every tool (XE 18/21, FREE 23ai, Always-Free ADB);
- honest three-tier CI;
- truthful docs (Homebrew/winget/npm retired);
- PL/SQL-intelligence built into every artifact, with custom PL/SQL tools under the fail-closed guard;
- all driver fixes and a working OCI ADB path;
- the Windows audit security proof;
- `oraclemcp-verifier` published;
- agent change requests on editions (W12), scoped grants (W13) and impact at every approval (W14);
- a field-safe `oraclemcp selftest`.

## Closure rule
This root closes **only** when the REL epic closes, i.e. when v0.12.0 is tagged, published and verified on every channel. It never closes on process output.

## Governance
The inherited `agent_context` carries the binding doctrine. AGENTS.md is the long-form law.

